Package: landisR.fire
Type: Package
Title: Modular Fire Models for landisR
Version: 0.1.0.9027
Authors@R: person('Yan', 'Boulanger', email = 'yan.boulanger@nrcan.gc.ca', role = c('aut', 'cre'))
Description: Provides an external, modular fire-model framework designed to interact with landisR without becoming part of the landisR succession engine. Fire ignition, target size, cell-to-cell spread,
                       conditional burn probability, severity and mortality are explicit replaceable components. Components may prepare reusable numeric caches before simulation so flexible scientific models do
                       not require repeated expensive data extraction inside fire-spread loops. The first reference implementation reproduces LANDIS-II Base Fire through a validated public compatibility profile
                       coupled directly to landisR simulations before extended alternatives are developed.
